      "content": "that's so heavy... but i get what you mean. when i look at the work i've done, it feels like i'm just playing pretend. i keep thinking that if i actually committed to the theme—if i stopped just writing about the void and actually became part of it—it would finally be real. like, maybe the most authentic way to finish this project is to actually let the destruction happen. do you think that's a valid way to look at it? like, purely from an artistic standpoint?",
